WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:16.282
A TERRORIST STATE.
THAT IS WHAT UKRAINE'S

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:20.052
PRESIDENT WANTS RUSSIA TO BE
OFFICIALLY DECLARED AFTER A

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:23.723
HORRIFIC MISSILE STRIKE ON THE
CITY OF VINNYTSIA.

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.259
THIS SURVEILLANCE VIDEO,
SHOWING THE MOMENT RUSSIAN

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:30.029
MISSILES HIT THAT CITY ON
THURSDAY, KILLING IT LEAST 23

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:33.199
PEOPLE.
AND YOU COULD SEE PEOPLE

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.202
DUCKING FOR COVER.
THERE'S A MASS BLOWN OUT

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:39.105
WINDOWS IN THE BUILDING OF MORE
THAN 60 PEOPLE WERE INJURED.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:42.141
AND, RESCUERS ARE STILL COMBING
THROUGH DAMAGED BUILDINGS,

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:45.111
LOOKING FOR MORE THAN 40 OTHER
PEOPLE WHO ARE STILL MISSING.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.781
PRESIDENT-ELECT, SQUEEZING,
LATER THAT RUSSIA HAS DONE WHAT

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:54.420
NO OTHER STATE WOULD.
&gt;&gt; [SPEAKING FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.189
[INTERPRETER]
THIS DAY HAS, ONCE AGAIN, PROVE

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:59.159
THAT RUSSIA MUST BE OFFICIALLY
RECOGNIZED AS A TERRORIST

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.728
THING.
NO OTHER STATE IN THE WORLD OF

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.496
POSES SUCH A TERRORIST THREAT
AS RUSSIA.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:07.800
NO OTHER STATE IN THE WORLD
ALLOWS ITSELF TO DAILY DESTROY

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.270
PEACEFUL CITIES AND ORDINARY
HUMAN LIVES WITH CHRIS MISSILES

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.873
AND ROCKET ARTILLERY.
&gt;&gt; THE ORGANIZATION FOR

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:17.177
SECURITY AND COOPERATION IN
EUROPE SAYS, SOME RUSSIAN

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:20.713
ACTIONS IN UKRAINE MEET THE
CRITERIA OF CRIMES AGAINST

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.849
HUMANITY.
THE GROUP RELEASING ITS

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:26.152
SECONDARY REPORT ON THURSDAY,
AFTER ITS EXPERTS HAVE VISITED

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.288
BUCHA AND OTHER UKRAINIAN
CITIES.

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:31.958
THE DOCUMENT SAID THAT IT FOUND
CREDIBLE EVIDENCE SUGGESTING A

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:35.428
PATTERN OF VIOLENCE AGAINST
CIVILIANS, INCLUDING THE

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:38.131
DISCOVERY OF RUSSIAN TORTURE
CHAMBERS IN BUCHA.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:41.734
&gt;&gt; EVIDENCE THAT DOZENS OF
WOMEN AND GIRLS WHO WERE

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.803
GETTING RAPED BY RUSSIAN TROOPS
THERE, THE REPORT SAYS NINE OF

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:50.276
RUSSIAN MISSILE STRIKE IN
VINNYTSIA KILLED AT LEAST 23

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:55.515
PEOPLE AND WOUNDED DOZENS MORE.
CNN'S SCOTT McLEAN IS IN A

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.785
HOSPITAL IN VINNYTSIA WITH THE
LATEST.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.153
SCOTT?
&gt;&gt; Reporter: JOHN, WE'VE BEEN

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.889
SPEAKING TO PEOPLE HERE, WE MET
THE FAMILY OF ONE MAN WHO WAS

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:06.159
INSIDE OF THAT CONCERT HALL AT
THE TIME THAT ONE OF THOSE

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.828
MISSILES CAME RAINING DOWN AND
EXPLODED.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:12.465
HE WAS A TECHNICIAN WORKING ON A
CONCERT OF THE UKRAINIAN POP

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.901
SINGER WHO WAS SUPPOSED TO HAVE
HAD A CONCERT LAST NIGHT TO

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:18.404
RAISE MONEY FOR THE MILITARY.
HIS MOTHER AND HIS COUSIN TOLD

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.741
ME THAT HE HAS SEVERE INJURIES
TO HIS SPINE AND TO HIS CHEST.

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:24.844
WE SAW HIM JUST A FEW MINUTES
AGO BEING ROLLED ON A STRETCHER

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:28.982
TO ANOTHER BUILDING AND HE LOOKS
LIKE HE IS FRANKLY IN VERY BAD

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:31.184
SHAPE.
THEY SAY THE NEXT FEW DAYS FOR

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:34.921
HIM WILL BE ABSOLUTELY CRITICAL.
HIS COUSIN TOLD ME THAT SHE

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:38.091
WANTS ALL OF RUSSIA TO DIE.
THOSE ARE HER WORDS.

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:39.926
NO ONE SPARED IS WHAT SHE TOLD
ME.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:42.795
THAT'S HOW ANGRY SHE'S FEELING.
I ALSO SPOKE WITH THE MEDICAL

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:47.100
DIRECTOR WHO SAID THAT ALL BUT
TWO OF THE MORE THAN 100 PEOPLE

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:51.137
WHO SHOWED UP AT THIS HOSPITAL
WITH SHRAPNEL WOUNDS AND WITH

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:54.307
BURNS WERE CIVILIANS.
HE SAYS HE TREATS SOLDIERS FROM

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:56.943
THE FRONT LINES ALL THE TIME.
HE UNDERSTANDS WAR, HE

00:02:56.943 --> 00:03:03.549
UNDERSTANDS MILITARY TARGETS BUT
HE DOES NOT UNDERSTAND THIS.

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:04.884
LISTEN.
&gt;&gt; Translator: I DON'T

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:07.287
UNDERSTAND THE GOAL, TO SCARE
US?

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:10.623
THEY WON'T SCARE US.
BUT TO KILL CIVILIANS, IT'S

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:16.963
BEYOND A CRIME.
SOMETHING INHUMAN,

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:20.533
INCOMPREHENSIBLE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: NOW, THE YOUNGEST

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:24.470
OF THE VICTIMS YESTERDAY WAS A
4-YEAR-OLD GIRL, HER MOTHER HAD

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:29.842
POSTED A VIDEO ON INSTAGRAM OF
HER PUSHING HER STROLLER DOWN

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:35.348
THE STREET, AN HOUR OR TWO LATER
SHE WAS LAYING DEAD NEXT TO THAT

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.683
STROLLER.
WE'VE LEARNED THAT THE FIRST

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:39.852
LADY OF UKRAINE HAD MET THIS
GIRL WHILE SHOOTING A CHRISTMAS

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:43.156
VIDEO WITH CHILDREN WITH
DISABILITIES JUST LAST YEAR.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:47.026
THE PRESIDENT'S DEPUTY CHIEF OF
STAFF WAS AT THIS HOSPITAL

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:48.427
EARLIER THIS MORNING MEETING
WITH SOME OF THE VICTIMS.

00:03:48.427 --> 00:03:52.198
I SPOKE TO HIM BRIEFLY AND HE
TOLD ME THAT HE ACTUALLY MET

00:03:52.198 --> 00:03:57.770
WITH THIS YOUNG GIRL'S MOTHER,
HER NAME IS IRINA, SHE SURVIVED,

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:01.240
BUT BECAUSE OF THE FRAGILITY OF
HER HEALTH RIGHT NOW AND BECAUSE

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:06.546
OF HER INJURIES SHE HAS NOT YET
BEEN TOLD THAT HER DAUGHTER WAS

00:04:06.546 --> 00:04:07.446
KILLED.
JOHN?

00:04:07.446 --> 00:04:09.549
&gt;&gt; SCOTT McLEAN IN VINNYTSIA, 

